# Chuan hoa line ending cho toan repo: luon LF trong git.
#
# Ly do: repo duoc develop tren WSL/Linux nhưng edit tren Windows bang
# VSCode/Notepad. Khong co quy uoc nay, editor Windows tu dong luu file
# thanh CRLF -> git bao "modified" cho moi file (chi khac byte 0x0D cuoi
# dong) va lam diff nhieu dong cho thay doi 1 dong that.
#
# "text=auto eol=lf" nghia la:
#   - git tu chuan hoa CRLF -> LF khi commit vao repo
#   - khi checkout tren Windows, file duoc ghi ra voi LF (editor Windows
#     hien dai van hien thi binh thuong)
* text=auto eol=lf

# File van ban / binary nen giu nguyen:
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.fs binary
